  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977005155180490832/1186829728972275743/MiniaturaCurseForge.jpg?ex=6594ac51&is=65823751&hm=d9e32a398989be12ac8153ffdad9804a4e002f1d52fc61601a57adb31368be7e&\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Sp2esSu.jpg\"></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">可馴服與騎乘的生物、每種生物的新馬鞍、新方塊、礦石、生態域與物品</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">需要 GeckoLib 模組&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#396\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下載</a></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#3cc\"><strong>注意：若遊戲發生崩潰，請刪除以下資料夾中的設定檔：.Minecraft/config/gammacreaturesconfig.json</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;color:#f00\"><strong>若您對使用本模組有所疑慮，請勿將其用於已建立或對您重要的世界，因為移除模組後將無法繼續遊玩該世界。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">這些生物會生成於世界各地，</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">您必須擊敗它們後才能進行馴服，</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">每種生物都擁有伽瑪能量，賦予它們特定的能力，</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">生物具備耐力系統，耐力耗盡時可使用名為「耐力膠囊」的物品恢復。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#333\">要馴服它們請參考指南書，以了解您需要哪種馴服道具。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">- 馬鞍：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IpIKcHE.png\" width=\"974\" height=\"730\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 物品：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>模組資訊書籍：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z4XTjnt.jpeg\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nZlZRpO.png\" width=\"941\" height=\"885\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>水晶球：</strong>（用途有限）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CgrXcRI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"716\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- 生物：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>TARU</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TLpfGLH.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"675\" height=\"539\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RADIOACTIVE HYENA</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RBsNdSX.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"611\" height=\"354\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ALUBIN</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M82nkF1.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"570\" height=\"330\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RADIOACTIVE SHARK</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Pv3GJTq.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"746\" height=\"432\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>LENNAT</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8KDMApW.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"644\" height=\"373\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MELORON</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KLjh9JE.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"811\" height=\"470\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RADIOACTIVE OWL</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SJVGvQ3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>XENDAH</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XRTuPQy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"445\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RADIOACTIVE BEE</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/J18DSKf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"727\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SPPINTO</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jLDfCxg.gif\"></p>\n<p>CAREYATROS</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPrVww5.gif\"></p>\n<p>BANNDU</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XGKldp7.gif\"></p>\n<p>RADIOACTIVE BEAR</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cSLUCVs.gif\"></p>\n<p>CRASU</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nz9BLWF.gif\"></p>\n<p>DOGISHI</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6yyA9Yn.gif\"></p>\n<p>DOSMO</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DM8u6ZZ.gif\"></p>\n<p>ZATLAH</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YiiwXOO.gif\"></p>\n<p>DIAMOND GOLEM</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/niVYtjk.gif\"></p>\n<p>GUSNOW</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x3G1F63.gif\"></p>\n<p>MOLLUTO</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SMfVJ0o.gif\"></p>\n<p>MUBA</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/giu3s4A.gif\"></p>\n<p>PANGOLIN</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKJpa5G.gif\"></p>\n<p>GRUDELS</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Z0vU5rl.gif\"></p>\n<p>SHECKO</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BA5zRzz.gif\"></p>\n<p>SKINNO</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/RNXMWaY.gif\" width=\"458\" height=\"417\"></p>\n<p>SPIDER</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AGASklL.gif\"></p>\n<p>REDTHUNDER</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NMBrHhp.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"297\"></p>\n<p>SNOVY</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IjqFXMG.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"288\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SfNabG3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"266\"></p>\n<p>DARKNIX</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hc4L4iH.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"252\"></p>\n<p>DRAZOR</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O9aMDMz.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"436\" height=\"245\"></p>\n<p>JUVEX</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/i8j1FEj.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"448\" height=\"252\"></p>\n<p>TURLAN</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IXORlRJ.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"236\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>版本：1.0.1</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;新增生物生成設定系統：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>為使其運作，您必須修改機率數值。但此數值為反比設定，即：數值越大，該生物生成的機率越低；數值越小，生成機率越高。<span style=\"color:#f00\">範圍 0 至 100 <span style=\"color:#000\">（設為 100 將完全停用該生物生成）</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xAfhZdE.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"324\"><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>實體列表：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/avuEiwc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"661\" height=\"377\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/amBeldHvq0A?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rg-fYka9XSA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Jv7Yyl7ZUG0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>您可以將此模組用於您的整合包，但請務必標示原作者。若有可能，請附上此論壇文章的連結。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>- 紋理與模型由 <span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">ALe96</span> 製作</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 音效由 <span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">ALe96</span> 編輯</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ALe9620LN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/47cq8jD.png\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\"></span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCgE5KOwkiUFAJCDEna9ADVw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bWaFgko.png\" width=\"29\" height=\"29\"></a></span></strong></p>",
